# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:Biohazard" by tools/quests/transcript_to_dialogue.py
0	section	Getting started
0	section	Talking to Elena
1	line	Player	Good day to you, Elena.
1	line	Elena	You too, thanks for freeing me.
1	line	Elena	It's just a shame the mourners confiscated my equipment.
1	line	Player	What did they take?
1	line	Elena	My distillator. I can't test any plague samples without it. They're holding it in the Mourner Headquarters in West Ardougne.
1	line	Elena	I must somehow retrieve that distillator if I am to find a cure for this awful affliction. Do you think you could help me?
1	select	Start the Biohazard quest?
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Player	Of course I can help. Where do we start?
2	line	Elena	I was hoping you would say that. Unfortunately they discovered the tunnel and filled it in. We need another way over the wall.
2	line	Player	Any ideas?
2	line	Elena	My father's friend Jerico is in communication with West Ardougne. He might be able to help us. He lives in a house south east of here, north of the chapel.
2	action	end
1	option	No.
2	line	Player	I'm busy at the moment, I'm afraid.
2	line	Elena	Fair enough.
2	action	end
0	section	Trying to dig in the mud patch
1	box	The ground's been filled in and packed hard.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Jerico
1	line	Player	Hello Jerico.
1	line	Jerico	Hello, I've been expecting you. Elena tells me you need to cross the wall.
1	line	Player	That's right.
1	line	Jerico	My messenger pigeons help me communicate with friends over the wall.
1	line	Jerico	I have arranged for two of them to aid you with a rope ladder. Omart is waiting for you at the southern end of the wall.
1	line	Jerico	But be careful, if the mourners catch you, the punishment will be severe.
1	line	Player	Thanks Jerico.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Jerico again
1	line	Jerico	Hello again. Have you spoken to Omart yet?
1	line	Player	Not yet.
1	line	Jerico	You'll find him at the southern end of the wall. Keep an eye out for them mourners.
1	action	end
0	section	Searching the cupboard
1	box	The cupboard is full of bird feed.
1	cond	If the player has no inventory space:
