1	line	Player	Hello nurse.
1	line	Nurse Sarah	I don't know how much longer I can cope here.
1	line	Player	What? Is the plague getting to you?
1	line	Nurse Sarah	No, strangely enough the people here don't seem to be affected. It's just the awful living conditions that is making people ill.
