0	section	Delivering the samples
0	section	Talking to Elena with the distillator
1	line	Elena	You're back, did you find the distillator?
1	line	Player	Yes, here it is!
1	line	Elena	Great! Now I can finally run these tests.
1	box	Elena uses the distillator to test some samples.
1	line	Elena	I don't understand... the touch paper hasn't changed colour at all...
1	line	Player	What does that mean?
1	line	Elena	I'm not sure. My old mentor in Varrock, Guidor, might know though. Could you take these to him and see what he thinks? You'll need to drop by the chemist in Rimmington first to pick up some more touch paper.
1	box	Elena gives you a plague sample along with three vials.
1	line	Elena	Now, last time I went to see Guidor, some one told the guards I was carrying some plague samples. Annoyingly, that means they've started searching everyone going to that part of the city.
1	line	Elena	Ironically, the guards won't be smart enough to recognise the sample itself, so you should be able to get that in just fine. They'll probably confiscate the rest though.
1	line	Player	So what do I do?
1	line	Elena	Well I know the chemist has still been managing to get chemicals to Guidor. Maybe he can help you smuggle the things in.
1	line	Player	Great, I'll see if he can help. See you soon.
1	action	end
