0	section	Talking to Chancy in Varrock after giving him the wrong vial
1	line	Player	Hi, thanks for doing that.
1	line	Chancy	No problem. I've got some money for you actually.
1	line	Player	What do you mean?
1	line	Chancy	Well, it turns out that potion you gave me, was quite valuable...
1	line	Player	What?
1	line	Chancy	I know that I probably shouldn't have sold it... but some friends and I were having a little wager, the odds were just too good!
1	line	Player	You sold my vial and gambled with the money?!
1	line	Chancy	Actually yes... but praise be to SaradomingSaradomin because I won! So all's well that ends well right?
