0	section	Talking to Da Vinci in Varrock after giving him the wrong vial
1	line	Da Vinci	Hello again. I hope your journey was as pleasant as mine.
1	line	Player	Yep. Anyway, I'll take the package off you now.
1	line	Da Vinci	Package? That's a funny way to describe a liquid of such exquisite beauty!
1	select	Select an Option
