0	section	Talking to Julie after talking to the Chemist
1	line	Player	Hello. I'm a friend of Elena, here to see Guidor.
1	line	Julie	I'm afraid that Guidor is not long for this world! So I'm not letting people see him now.
1	line	Player	I'm really sorry to hear about Guidor.
1	line	Player	But I do have some very important business to attend to!
1	line	Julie	You heartless rogue! What could be more important than Guidor's life? A life spent well, if not always wisely... I just hope that Saradomin shows mercy on his soul!
1	line	Player	Guidor is a religious man?
1	line	Julie	Oh goodness no! But I am! If only I could get him to see a priest!
1	line	Player	A priest? Hmmm...
1	action	end
