0	section	Talking to Guidor
1	line	Player	Hello, you must be Guidor. I understand that you are unwell.
1	line	Guidor	Is my wife asking priests to visit me now? I'm a man of science for god's sake. I know she means well but it's only a little cough!
1	line	Player	She made out it was something more serious.
1	line	Guidor	Well it's not killed me yet. So what do you want?
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	I've come to ask your assistance in stopping a plague.
2	line	Player	I've come to ask your assistance in stopping a plague.
2	line	Guidor	You mean the plague of West Ardougne?
2	line	Player	That's the one. I have a sample here from your former student, Elena.
2	line	Guidor	Elena eh?
2	line	Player	Yes, she wants you to analyse it. You might be the only one who can help.
2	line	Guidor	Right then, sounds like we'd better get to work!
2	line	Player	I have the plague sample.
2	line	Guidor	Now I'll be needing some liquid honey, some sulphuric broline, and then...
2	line	Player	... some ethenea?
2	line	Guidor	Indeed!
2	cond	If the player does not have all three vials:
3	line	Guidor	Look, I need all three reagents to test the plague sample. Come back when you've got them.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player does not have touch paper:
3	line	Guidor	Oh. You don't have any touch paper. I won't be able to help after all.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player does not have the plague sample:
3	line	Guidor	Seems like you don't actually have the plague sample. It's a long way to come empty handed... and quite a long way back too.
3	action	end
2	line	Guidor	Now I'll just apply these to the sample and... I don't get it... the touch paper has remained the same.
2	line	Player	That's why Elena wanted you to do it, because she wasn't sure what was happening.
2	line	Guidor	Well that's just it, nothing has happened. I don't know what this sample is, but it certainly isn't toxic.
2	line	Player	So what about the plague?
2	line	Guidor	This result can only mean one thing... there is no plague. It seems that someone has been lying about all of it. The only question is... why?
2	line	Player	Well this is worrying. I'd better go and tell Elena right away.
2	action	end
1	option	I was just going to bless your room and I've done that now.
2	line	Player	I was just going to bless your room and I've done that now.
2	line	Guidor	Oh. Goodbye then.
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Guidor again
1	line	Player	Hello again Guidor.
1	line	Guidor	Well, hello traveller. I still can't understand why they would lie about the plague.
1	line	Player	It's strange, anyway how are you doing?
1	line	Guidor	I'm hanging in there.
1	line	Player	Good for you.
1	action	end
