2	line	Player	I am. What's our plan?
2	line	King Lathas	Well, as we've previously discussed, my brother is currently gathering strength in the lands west of here. The only known way into those lands is through the Underground Pass.
2	action	(Continues with Underground Pass dialogue.)
1	option	I'm just passing through.
2	line	Player	I'm just passing through.
2	line	King Lathas	Fair enough. Return to me when you are ready and we will discuss our next steps.
2	action	end
